# Build artifacts
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
**/publish/

# IDE / editor
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# Version control
**/.git/
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes

# Docker
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore
